 progress, and failures.\n- Prove worker-count-independent bytes where deterministic, semantic output, diagnostics, Primary/Secondary Failures, cancellation, rollback, and return-after-settlement behavior.\n- Pass bounded/out-of-order stress and record 1/2/4/8/16-worker scaling, throughput, memory, and backpressure qualification before merge.\n\n## Ownership\n\nAgent-driven when unblocked and labelled ready-for-agent.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not expand this issue beyond its independently mergeable outcome or bypass a native blocker relationship.\n- Never modify the pinned TES5Edit Reference Snapshot or commit proprietary/local game assets.\n- Do not add GUI behavior, non-Windows guarantees, Maven Central/GitHub Packages publication, or moving-reference compatibility.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/48/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/48/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/47","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/47/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/47/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/47/events","html_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/47","id":5333337018,"node_id":"I_kwDOULuKyc8AAAABPeRDug","number":47,"title":"Implement Fallout 4 BA2 v7 and v8 decoding","user":{"login":"evildarkarchon","id":11204783,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjA0Nzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11204783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evildarkarchon","html_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us